{"name":"En Plein Air","hex":"#d0c5be","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"en plein air","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["in the open air, alfresco, outside, outdoors"]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["in the open air, alfresco, outside, outdoors"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/en_plein_air"}],"entries":[{"title":"En plein air","blocks":[{"text":"En plein air, or plein-air painting, is the act of painting outdoors."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Peinture_de_plein_air.jpg/330px-Peinture_de_plein_air.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/En_plein_air"},{"title":"Plein","blocks":[{"text":"Plein is an Ortsgemeinde – a municipality belonging to a Verbandsgemeinde, a kind of collective municipality – in the Bernkastel-Wittlich district in Rhineland-Palatinate, Germany. It belongs to the Verbandsgemeinde of Wittlich-Land, whose seat is in Wittlich, although that town is itself not in the Verbandsgemeinde."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Plein_in_WIL.svg/330px-Plein_in_WIL.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plein"},{"title":"Atmosphere of Earth","blocks":[{"text":"The atmosphere of Earth consists of a layer of mixed gas that is retained by gravity, surrounding the Earth's surface. It contains variable quantities of suspended aerosols and particulates that create weather features such as clouds and hazes. The atmosphere serves as a protective buffer between the Earth's surface and outer space. It shields the surface from most meteoroids and ultraviolet solar radiation, reduces diurnal temperature variation – the temperature extremes between day and night, and keeps it warm through heat retention via the greenhouse effect. The atmosphere redistributes heat and moisture among different regions via 